in which  the United States has either been  complicit or the instigator and I think  this is a rare opportunity we have  to interfere ahead of time but time is  running out for the activists the US  government says the protesters are  breaking the law and will have to leave  he forced embassies like the one behind  me and now becoming flashpoints in an  international tug of war between two men  who are both claiming to be president of  one country nearly 60 nations have  joined the Trump administration in  backing one Guido  but this embassy in Washington remains a  rare outpost of support for Maduro
 

